  "adaptations": [
    "Preserve pinned date/range state transactions using existing native controlled/form/overlay state.",
    "Reuse original CUIDateSegment inputs and ordered named value/start/end group descriptors; no editor replacement or value/selection write.",
    "Use actual owned collection root/header/day metadata, current target registrations, key policies and passive native window pointer observations.",
    "Retain the fixed source200ms touch admission, actual hit/release/cancel/termination and source keyboard/range semantics without SDK flag, hook or dependency changes.",
    "Reuse existing native colors/borders/motion, floating placement/window/focus and real View/ref ownership. Root and day requests remain distinct from original native focus observation.",
    "Source, consumer, compiler products and installed/profile acceptance are separate gates. Ordinary framework hover delivery and every native profile remain unqualified."
  ]
